       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reported in IATI tool;To be reported directly by Ho;To be reported in Q4 by HO;Multicommunity based development initiatives (MUCOBADI), operating in Bugiri District has a partnership agreement with TdH NL that runs until 2025. Partner capacity assessment was conducted and this is reviewed every quarter to ascertain the areas of growth and capacity building sessions conducted to strengthen their Programming; Finance; MEAL as well as partnerships/ networking with other CSOs.
